TY3NTAxMDQw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels/Team:QL%20(Deprecated)","name":"Team:QL (Deprecated)","color":"fef2c0","default":false,"description":"Meta label for query languages team"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2020-07-02T15:26:09Z","updated_at":"2020-10-15T10:41:54Z","closed_at":"2020-10-15T10:41:54Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Given a field with the mapping:\r\n```\r\n\"datetime0\" : {\r\n    \"type\" : \"date\",\r\n    \"format\" : \"yyyy-MM-dd' 'HH:mm:ss\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\nand a query with the `IN` filtering: `SELECT datetime0 FROM idx WHERE datetime0 IN ('2000-11-11 11:11:11'::timestamp)` will raise an exception:\r\n```\r\n\"root_cause\" : [\r\n      {\r\n        \"type\" : \"parse_exception\",\r\n        \"reason\" : \"failed to parse date field [2000-11-11T11:11:11Z] with format [yyyy-MM-dd' 'HH:mm:ss]: [failed to parse date field [2000-11-11T11:11:11Z] with format [yyyy-MM-dd' 'HH:mm:ss]]\"\r\n      }\r\n    ]\r\n```\r\nThe query executes correctly with the equality operator.\r\nData in the index is irrelevant (the index can contain no documents).","closed_by":{"login":"bpintea","id":1562801,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjI4MDE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1562801?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bpintea","html_url":"https://github.com/bpintea","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bpintea/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bpintea/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bpintea/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bpintea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bpintea/su